#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "That record belongs to a Cacti device you do not have permission for. Nothing was changed."
msgstr "Den posten tillhör en Cacti-enhet som du inte har behörighet till. Ingenting ändrades."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Name: another filesystem of this backend already uses this name."
msgstr "Namn: ett annat filsystem i denna backend använder redan detta namn."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The filesystem could not be saved."
msgstr "Filsystemet kunde inte sparas."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The filesystem was saved."
msgstr "Filsystemet sparades."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The filesystem, its nodes, and its inventory were deleted. Its Cacti device, data sources, and graphs were kept. No node was contacted."
msgstr "Filsystemet, dess noder och dess inventering togs bort. Dess Cacti-enhet, datakällor och grafer behölls. Ingen nod kontaktades."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Name: another node already uses this name."
msgstr "Namn: en annan nod använder redan detta namn."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The node could not be saved."
msgstr "Noden kunde inte sparas."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The node was saved."
msgstr "Noden sparades."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The node was deleted. Targets it reported keep their history."
msgstr "Noden togs bort. Mål som den rapporterat behåller sin historik."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Enter a network as an address and prefix length, such as 10.20.0.0/16."
msgstr "Ange ett nätverk som en adress och prefixlängd, till exempel 10.20.0.0/16."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "No device was added: the filesystem already has one, or the templates are not installed."
msgstr "Ingen enhet lades till: filsystemet har redan en, eller så är mallarna inte installerade."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device could not be mapped. It may be mapped to another filesystem."
msgstr "Enheten kunde inte kopplas. Den kan redan vara kopplad till ett annat filsystem."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device was mapped and the data queries and overview graphs were added."
msgstr "Enheten kopplades och datafrågorna samt översiktsgraferna lades till."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Cacti did not create the device. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Cacti skapade inte enheten. Se Cacti-loggen."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device, its data queries, and its overview graphs were created."
msgstr "Enheten, dess datafrågor och dess översiktsgrafer skapades."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device is no longer mapped. It and its graphs were kept; its data queries list no targets until it is mapped again."
msgstr "Enheten är inte längre kopplad. Den och dess grafer behölls; dess datafrågor listar inga mål förrän den kopplas igen."

#: pfs_health.php
msgid "The templates and data query files were installed."
msgstr "Mallarna och datafrågefilerna installerades."

#: pfs_health.php
#, php-format
msgid "The templates could not be installed: %s"
msgstr "Mallarna kunde inte installeras: %s"

#: pfs_operator.php
msgid "Monitoring view"
msgstr "Övervakningsvy"

#: pfs_operator.php
msgid "Observations could not be read. Ask an administrator to check the plugin log."
msgstr "Observationer kunde inte läsas. Be en administratör att kontrollera tilläggets logg."

